      "content": "Wait, why are you bringing up goblins again? I'm trying to write a formal linguistics paper, not a fantasy story. \n\nCan we please just stay on the technical side of things? You were explaining the difference in turbulence, but I need specifically how the constriction of the oral cavity affects the spectral peaks. How does that \"abrasive\" quality you mentioned relate to the actual frequency distribution in the higher registers, without the analogies?",
